KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Principles of Accounts (Year 2020)

Q1. Which accounting concept dictates that revenue is recognized when earned, regardless of when cash is received?
  (A) Accrual Concept
  (B) Going Concern
  (C) Prudence
  (D) Money Measurement
  Answer: A - The Accrual Concept requires revenues and expenses to be recognized when incurred.


